  m_text: "Local legends tell of a modern vehicle that revealed itself in an oracle\u2019s
    dream, gleaming with divine purpose. From that night onward, the townsfolk of
    Evuul-Kult have believed wholeheartedly in the deity behind the vision."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
