  m_text: Beneath the shrine, the underpass winds like a silent, shadowed artery,
    its stone walls slick with age and moisture. The air is thick and cool, carrying
    a faint, earthy scent that hints at the passage of countless footsteps long past.
    Echoes linger here, turning even the slightest sound into a whisper of forgotten
    rituals.
